## Command

```shell
biome check --write file.vue
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "html": {
    "formatter": { "enabled": true },
    "linter": { "enabled": true },
    "experimentalFullSupportEnabled": true
  }
}
```

## `file.vue`

```vue
<template>
	<Component v-slot="{ value }: { value: ValueType }">{{
		value.innerValue
	}}</Component>
	<Component #item="{ item = fallback }: { item?: ItemType }">{{
		item
	}}</Component>
</template>
<script lang="ts" setup>
import Component from "./Component.vue";

interface ValueType {
	innerValue: string;
}
type ItemType = string;
const fallback: ItemType = "fallback";
</script>

```

# Emitted Messages

```block
Checked 1 file in <TIME>. Fixed 1 file.
```
